Marketing Funnel Analysis Dashboard 📊

This project presents an analysis of an online retail marketing funnel using Power BI.

Dataset

The dataset used for this analysis was obtained from Kaggle and contains information about visitors, leads, and customer conversions.

Objective

The goal of this project is to analyze the marketing funnel and understand how users move from website visitors → leads → customers, and identify possible drop-off points in the funnel.

Tools Used

- Power BI
- Data Cleaning and Visualization
- Marketing Funnel Analysis

Key Insights

- Sales show strong seasonality, with the highest revenue generated in Q4, especially in November.
- A small number of top-selling products contribute significantly to overall revenue.
- Conversion rates highlight potential drop-off points between visitors and leads.

